# Place your test images here.
#
# Drop .jpg / .jpeg / .png files in this folder. The simulator client
# (backend/demo/simulate_client.py) will read every image found here,
# send it to the detection server through the WebSocket and print the
# detected objects and the scene risk assessment.
#
# This folder is mounted into both the server and the simulator containers
# by docker-compose, so you can add or change images without rebuilding.
